Recommends: python3-giacpy
Description: Computer Algebra System library and CLI tools
 GIAC is a C++ library for symbolic and numeric computation (Computer
 Algebra System). It provides:
    - libgiac: core CAS shared library
    - icas: interactive command-line CAS shell
    - aide: help tool
 .
 The Xcas graphical frontend is available as a separate package.
 .
 Bernard Parisse is the main author.
